---
title: Voucher state machine (author 523C0007, AI-assisted)
---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction LR
    [*] --> Draft : createVoucher() [data valid, code unique]
    Draft --> Draft : updateVoucher() / any field
    Draft --> Active : activateVoucher() [end date not passed]
    Draft --> [*] : deleteVoucher() [never used]
    Active --> Active : updateVoucher() / description, end date, limit only
    Active --> Active : used on an order / usedCount + 1
    Active --> Expired : [today > endDate or usedCount = usageLimit]
    Active --> Deactivated : deactivateVoucher()
    Expired --> Deactivated : deactivateVoucher()
    Deactivated --> [*]
    note right of Expired
        Derived state: computed from the
        dates and usage, not stored
    end note
